# Multi Select

A versatile multi-select component that allows users to pick multiple options from grouped lists with an easy-to-use search and chip-based interface.

## Installation

::div{.space-y-4}
```bash
bunx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/multi-select.json
```

```bash
npx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/multi-select.json
```

```bash
pnpm dlx shadcn-vue@latest add https://dano-registry.vercel.app/r/multi-select.json
```
::

## Usage

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { MultiSelect } from '@/registry/multi-select'

const selected = ref([])
const options = [
  {
    heading: 'Fruits',
    items: [
      { text: 'Apple', value: 'apple' },
      { text: 'Banana', value: 'banana' },
    ]
  }
]
</script>

<template>
  <MultiSelect 
    v-model="selected" 
    :data="options" 
  />
</template>
```

