### Props

| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `data` | `MultiSelectDataProp[]` | `undefined` | The hierarchical data structure containing headings and items. |
| `config` | `Object` | `Default labels` | Custom labels for empty states and search placeholder. |
| `v-model` | `string[]` | `[]` | Array of selected values. |
